l=A.a(["Aadhaar Card","Land Records (7/12, Patta)","Caste Certificate (if applicable)","Bank passbook and manufacturer quotation"],f)
l=A.u5(A.a(["Step 1: Register on Agricultural Mechanization Portal (agrimachinery.nic.in).","Step 2: Select machine type, dealer, and upload quotation.","Step 3: Administrative sanction issued based on target lottery/queue."],f),d,"Machinery","Enhances farm productivity and addresses agricultural labor shortages by incentivizing farm equipment purchase and establishing Custom Hiring Centers (CHCs) in rural areas.",e,"scheme_smam",i,"Sub-Mission on Agricultural Mechanization (SMAM)","Mechanization & Technology Division, MoA&FW","https://agrimachinery.nic.in",l,"40% to 50% subsidy on procurement of tractors, power tillers, rotavators, and harvesters.")
